    "route_response": "Ordered tetragonal A versus L12-like B has all-ten λ gain and separate Eliashberg +0.553 K, despite a small geometrical difference. Like-species nearest-distance contrasts remain nonzero in the saved network. Complete species-channel geometry differences and computed all-σ pairing response are saved against the frozen controls. Cell/grid/method sensitivity prevents a pure geometry-only causal claim; no bandwidth/carrier quantity is substituted.",
